<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tradewinds 1996 net up 91.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tradewinds 1996 net up 91.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   143.66   vs	  75.02</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	   52.8    vs	  28.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		     457.59   vs	 442.63</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     197.06   vs	 106.60</p>
<p>    Minorities		     nil    vs  less   0.14</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	    7.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Tradewinds (M) Bhd. It is involved in palm oil production, sugar refining and trading, and manufacture and trading of food products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
